              <lg xml:id="m-2e9eb05e-c85d-4af7-a9f7-756db4e21d6c">
                <l xml:id="m-b37e4bab-e186-4d99-8f8f-33c8c65cd0e3" facs="#m-80af3511-0947-4966-a45c-6fe89226d24f" label="text-like">1080 Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria.</l><l xml:id="m-4ed5bd89-d5c6-4359-bb28-0949e2efecae" facs="#m-e9a2e0a6-ef2b-4986-9b69-04edea18f17e" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-6887cba6-fc11-4f26-97fd-02236e623745" facs="#m-3f764faf-9315-4a06-8fd9-aafa6734a462" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-7954b367-747b-40cf-8774-0a7772933a72" facs="#m-32201be9-5678-4d7a-9daa-d5658f4d8980" label="ambiguous">Ant. I.f</l><l xml:id="m-03d4c0d5-fe47-4db8-9ec9-5a693732e7e0" facs="#m-0121fe06-083f-4586-a5d1-68b894c94ea1" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-9e336510-43f6-4702-a178-394210ba51ac" facs="#m-ce21c71c-fc9d-42ad-b23f-635bfa47da3d" label="lyrics-like">-men dí-co vóbis: * qui-a non praeter-i-bit ge¬</l><l xml:id="m-b82866ec-c12c-4af9-b3f7-fbf27cdd04cc" facs="#m-0b6b9367-4c80-4b74-a67a-c31436169c7f" label="lyrics-like">et tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1138345-0a9e-48de-89d9-1cdfb1e3eac9" facs="#m-c5797b67-5bc8-4b7b-843b-fde451fe1da4" label="lyrics-like">ne-rá-ti-o haec, donec ómni-a fí-ant: caé-lum</l><l xml:id="m-a7f7ffac-aeaf-4891-b5df-b3b047319987" facs="#m-9127a53e-64f6-4f41-b07d-19963519554d" label="lyrics-like">ra transí-bunt, vérba autem mé¬a non transsbunt, dí-cit</l><l xml:id="m-ad6fac06-be4f-4b42-98fd-1e9dd8874302" facs="#m-1e38e3ab-c575-477b-abad-5a89c78e9ab5" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-18af042a-599a-409d-b103-e4e638fdc43b" facs="#m-816ddb21-fd17-47ee-ab6c-3903be4f9fca" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. I. f. p. 207. — Prayer. Excita. p. 1078.</l><l xml:id="m-a0fc0dd5-944d-46e5-ba7a-d30799ae2d42" facs="#m-2b2261d3-5adc-4406-b100-91e9c3a67bf8" label="ambiguous">Rc ccda¬</l><l xml:id="m-e04f34db-5212-4437-a796-0702c2fdc036" facs="#m-4e90cf2e-4175-44b2-9279-b0b44d9cb072" label="text-like">ANTIPHONS OF THE SEASON.</l><l xml:id="m-0f67b39f-e7d3-425f-bc1c-9ec4d5d9be54" facs="#m-7a7ddec1-8ca1-40af-aca7-b00e7c6fdc5a" label="text-like">At the Benedictus and at the Magnificat.</l><l xml:id="m-a98d3336-af6b-4261-b602-863defdcc9ea" facs="#m-30d07e4b-b244-4eb3-ab4b-0618f647f71e" label="text-like">SAID AS COMMEMORATIONS OF THE SUNDAY OR OF THE FERIA</l><l xml:id="m-d96fb110-63a5-4da4-9645-4718aa02672b" facs="#m-fb902437-83d8-4056-9d03-ffa4d4676bc9" label="text-like">ON FEASTS OF THE FIRST CLASS.</l><l xml:id="m-70e37d8b-65d0-4708-b649-b3e774c1f439" facs="#m-60dabf21-bd83-4cc2-ab33-f39101428fe3" label="text-like">First Week of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-7e0fabeb-dbdc-44a3-9a32-9fdb3766b1cf" facs="#m-76f467e5-0a56-4107-b0a5-43eeefc4adf4" label="ambiguous">Thursday.</l><l xml:id="m-ee14cf4f-5853-489d-b5b5-df59ec032f2a" facs="#m-3cbead2e-f123-472d-be43-a25092ee7a01" label="text-like">At Vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-e2ebd459-7a44-4b82-bd93-a02f92fa48b9" facs="#m-073d01a3-4e94-4412-b8c7-97d070bc2ede" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-dc6d0bb2-f34a-4b82-9308-4621008aa50a" facs="#m-472cfaf0-8583-44b4-b257-45e59923ca82" label="lyrics-like">Xspectábo Dóminum “Salva-tórem mé-um, et</l><l xml:id="m-0b71ef70-aa51-4b5c-9939-efa6629d723c" facs="#m-069137af-e982-4155-9746-6bea759d1a65" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-b4a94a5a-02fc-4a43-b40c-00a090b26d07" facs="#m-ed5ccedc-e6bf-4ed2-8ef6-2ed5a7bcb724" label="lyrics-like">praesto-lábor é¬ um, dum prope est, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-29be3144-8a95-4434-84fb-617e7be0616b" facs="#m-c84d578a-6e1f-4548-ba58-82fe8a7f4490" label="lyrics-like">v. Roráte caéli désuper, et núbes plúant jústum.</l><l xml:id="m-be32fd02-cd9a-4c29-ac0f-4ca30ead3b91" facs="#m-055faf61-4d2f-4747-af76-7c9510362867" label="lyrics-like">K. Aperiátur térra et gérminet Salvatórem.</l><l xml:id="m-a0bd2dbd-addd-4620-9a69-faf5a1844db6" facs="#m-bd98eea4-6b79-4035-be10-0d85ecbe407f" label="text-like">Prayer of the preceding Sunday.</l></lg>
            </div>
